## 📌 Kaise Use Karna Hai

### Method 1: Direct GitHub pe (Sabse Aasan)

1. Apne repo pe jao: `https://github.com/vishakha2121/legacy-ai-modernizer`
2. `README.md` file pe click karo
3. **Pencil icon** (Edit) pe click karo
4. Sara purana content delete karo → Upar wala pura markdown paste karo
5. Neeche **Commit changes** → **Commit changes** button dabao
6. Done! ✅

### Method 2: Local se (CMD)

1. Apne project folder mein `README.md` file banao
2. Upar wala pura content paste karke save karo
3. Phir ye commands chalao:

```cmd
git add README.md
git commit -m "docs: add professional README"
git push
