Error	Fix
.env still visible on GitHub	git rm --cached backend/.env phir commit
venv folder push ho raha	git rm -r --cached venv/ phir commit
node_modules upload ho gaya	git rm -r --cached frontend/node_modules
.gitkeep file missing	Manually backend/app/static/uploads/.gitkeep bana
📝 Bonus: .gitkeep kyun?
Git empty folders ko track nahi karta. Toh jab tu uploads/ folder push karega, Git usse ignore kar dega. Isliye ek dummy file .gitkeep daal dete hain taaki folder GitHub pe dikhe.

Command se banao:

cmd
type nul > backend\app\static\uploads\.gitkeep
🎯 Full Command Sequence (Ek Saath)
Agar sab kuch ek saath karna hai:

cmd
echo. > .gitignore
Phir .gitignore file kholo, upar wala content paste karo, save karo.

cmd
git add .gitignore
git commit -m "chore: add .gitignore for Python, Node, DB, and env files"
git push
Bhai, bas itna kar — .gitignore bana, paste kar, push kar. Tera repo clean aur professional dikhega. 💪

