📄 Complete .gitignore File — Copy-Paste Ready
Bhai, ye tera full .gitignore hai jo backend (Python) + frontend (React/Node) + database + IDE + OS sab cover karta hai. Isko project ke root folder mein .gitignore naam se save kar de.

🎯 ROOT .gitignore (Copy-Paste This)
gitignore
# ============================================
# LEGACY AI MODERNIZER - GITIGNORE
# ============================================

# ---------- Python / Backend ----------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
lib/
lib64/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
share/python-wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg
MANIFEST

# Virtual Environments
venv/
env/
ENV/
env.bak/
venv.bak/
.venv/
backend/venv/
backend/.venv/

# PyInstaller
*.manifest
*.spec

# Unit test / coverage
htmlcov/
.tox/
.nox/
.coverage
.coverage.*
.cache
nosetests.xml
coverage.xml
*.cover
*.py,cover
.hypothesis/
.pytest_cache/
cover/

# Jupyter Notebook
.ipynb_checkpoints

# mypy
.mypy_cache/
.dmypy.json
dmypy.json

# ---------- Node / Frontend ----------
node_modules/
frontend/node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

# Build output
frontend/dist/
frontend/build/
dist-ssr/
*.local

# Vite
.vite/
frontend/.vite/

# npm / yarn / pnpm cache
.npm/
.yarn/
.pnp.*
.yarn-integrity

# ---------- Environment Variables ----------
.env
.env.local
.env.development.local
.env.test.local
.env.production.local
backend/.env
frontend/.env
*.env.local

# ---------- Database ----------
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
backend/data/*.db
database/*.db
database/*.sqlite
database/*.sqlite3

# ---------- Uploads / Static ----------
backend/app/static/uploads/*
!backend/app/static/uploads/.gitkeep

# ---------- Logs ----------
logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
backend/logs/
backend/*.log

